&_nc_oc=Ado7tCShFrE_ehpvpUfK97cQ2jWZB_9geOcfqFFB0BvUFDZLvtfiQVWiivu036q4VQ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwGO2bG_FguoXqTz7dmdpcIhlAN_uie3F9-_jUtQz4FCQ&oe=69C5157E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xGJSc5oMiA4Q7kNvwFTSUm3&_nc_oc=AdrUpfMuWRJeY2huLegmgYXAdVlGlcXtyMtBhbAJ8dJpE1XigIq3fXFW_dgtrUloj2U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afy0Mpi1svGeS6H0jUKGIV2j16noYq_lEXAShqLGVpz-CA&oe=69C5267C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p2dpRKFrh00Q7kNvwFu1XPG&_nc_oc=AdptRzJATrJ8x0yJYY8ITAU_NYrZqJTidrktlDK7PAjtUZ9fhHAgud8516IXmbgk9bE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzJ1vINklEqC2x7uZ7KjmBLDokRm40xCi8xOEULgile2A&oe=69C54507"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MmO6RsaU9WQQ7kNvwE8wtz_&_nc_oc=Adogge6uKnU7-j8fmCGPDfIlcx4q74MUmYw9dQj752Klk9c7aJDrpX10Dz1M_0ES0L4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afw6ej3c-Heu7beC0Me0rhBzDzcIg19pvPf4tVHw9t3ENA&oe=69C530D5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xle5DtTbwa8Q7kNvwGIFkWY&_nc_oc=Adoc6nHi371xlO55xsPQgYN482ClU8UBEJcFhqQg_wRrOwSJWrklRAfPQKfOf9KoC4c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxLtO7s7a-P72ZN7-hTv4IkE2xHxzoe74oPv8k3S2Wkgg&oe=69C53D64"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.